cisive."}, {"turn": 52, "text": "The 14k answered with J1, the worst move of its game at 26.1 points lost. The lead went from -26.0 to +0.2, and neither side lost anything meaningful afterward. The game settled into a draw."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberty count, and count.py flood-fills empty regions to tally area score with named dead stones removed. Both work only on the current position, and neither generates, ranks or looks ahead at moves.", "stop": false}}